#{[17592186233367 "Let $\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find a unit vector that is parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$ and points the same direction."] [17592186406696 "Consider the function\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{F}(x,y,z)=2x{y}^{3}z\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+(3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}z+{z}^{2})\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}+({x}^{2}{y}^{3}+2yz)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{k}.\n$$\n\nFind $f(x,y,z)$ such that $\\mathrm{∇}f(x,y,z)=\\mathbf{F}(x,y,z).$"] [17592186406697 "Find $f(x,y)$ such that $\\mathrm{∇}f=\\mathbf{F},$ where $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=2x\\operatorname{sin}y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+({x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}y+3{y}^{2})\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}.$"] [17592186406698 "Find $f(x,y,z)$ such that $\\mathrm{∇}f(x,y,z)=\\mathbf{F}(x,y,z),$ where $\\mathbf{F}(x,y,z)=(2x+y)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+(2y+x+z)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}+(y-2z)\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{k}.$"] [17592186406699 "Find $f(x,y)$ such that $\\mathrm{∇}f(x,y)=\\mathbf{F}(x,y),$ where $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(\\operatorname{sin}y+y)\\text{ }\\mathbf{i}+(x\\operatorname{cos}y+x)\\text{ }\\mathbf{j}.$"] [17592186406700 "Find $f(x,y)$ such that $\\mathrm{∇}f=\\mathbf{F},$ where $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=2xy\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+({x}^{2}+3{y}^{2})\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}.$"] [17592186415313 "Calculate the circulation $Γ$ of the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}-x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ along the circle $C$ with equation ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=4$ oriented counterclockwise."] [17592186415315 "Calculate the circulation $Γ$ of the vector field $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=-y\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{i}+x\\hspace{0.167em}\\mathbf{j}$ along the circle $C$ with equation ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=5$ oriented counterclockwise."] [17592186415866 "Use Green's theorem to evaluate $$\n{∮}_{C}\\mathbf{F}\\cdot \\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{r},\n$$ where $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=⟨6{x}^{2}-xy+11,{y}^{2}+1⟩$ and $C$ is the boundary of the triangle with vertices at $(0,0),$ $(2,-1)$ and $(2,1).$"] [17592186420301 "The closed, p